  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_002 (pca_n2000 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, avgpool, weighted) achieves the highest accuracy (0.635). This experiment tests whether switching the image encoder to resnet50 (while keeping RNA encoder, aggregation, and fusion consistent) improves performance. It isolates the effect of the image encoder, a key design choice, to determine if resnet50 is better than imagenet_vit_l. This balances exploitation (building on the current top setup) and exploration (testing a critical component)."
